	(text "J2 pin numbering assumes square pad = pin 1 on the D50A\n(pin 1 = G of the Channel 1 row, verified against P- with a meter 2026-09-12).\nNOT YET CONFIRMED against the ribbon cable. Do not freeze footprints\nuntil continuity is checked end-to-end with the delivered cable.\n\nJ2 引脚编号基于\"方形焊盘 = D50A 的 1 号脚\"（1 号 = Channel 1 那排的 G，\n2026-09-12 已用万用表对 P- 验证）。排线尚未到货，未做端到端实测确认。\n锁定封装前必须用实物排线逐根量通。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
